<title>UK: EU leaves distant sorghum import duty unchanged.</title>
<headline>EU leaves distant sorghum import duty unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will leave duties on transatlantic imports of sorghum unchanged on Wednesday at 71.59 Ecus a tonne, revised European Commission figures showed.</p>
<p>Earlier, trade sources had been confused by Commission figures suggesting a huge increase in the duty.</p>
<p>The figures showed that the EU will raise duties on medium quality wheat imports to 53.04 Ecus per tonne from 46.46 while leaving all others unchanged.</p>
</text>
